  "summary": "<p>Today, President Donald J. Trump stood with the families of murder victims to condemn Gov. Gavin Newsom’s gutless decision to wipe out the death sentences of all 548 inmates on California’s death row. Two days after the election, Newsom handed blanket clemency to child killers, serial murderers, and cop killers, and the victims’ families say [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trump-stands-with-victims-families-as-newsom-grants-mass-clemency-to-depraved-killers/\">President Trump Stands with Victims’ Families as Newsom Grants Mass Clemency to Depraved Killers</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
